    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Little Bone, wakes up in a forest only to discover that their body has been reduced to a skeleton. As they explore the forest further, they uncover an incredible mystery: the souls of animals and humans seem to have been inexplicably swapped. Can they piece together the clues to unravel the truth behind the forest and discover their own true identity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High freedom and multiple exploration paths, with scattered bits of information gradually surfacing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls paired with ingenious design and puzzles, where every item has a unique function and purpose. Often, the path forward lies just beneath your feet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with <strong>WASD</strong>, interact with the mouse.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Little Bone, wakes up in a forest only to discover that their body has been reduced to a skeleton. As they explore the forest further, they uncover an incredible mystery: the souls of animals and humans seem to have been inexplicably swapped. Can they piece together the clues to unravel the truth behind the forest and discover their own true identity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High freedom and multiple exploration paths, with scattered bits of information gradually surfacing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls paired with ingenious design and puzzles, where every item has a unique function and purpose. Often, the path forward lies just beneath your feet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with <strong>WASD</strong>, interact with the mouse.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\u4e3b\u89d2\u5c0f\u9aa8\u5728\u68ee\u6797\u91cc\u9192\u6765\uff0c\u5374\u53d1\u73b0\u8eab\u4f53\u53ea\u5269\u9ab7\u9ac5\u9aa8\u67b6\uff0c\u800c\u968f\u7740\u5bf9\u4e8e\u68ee\u6797\u7684\u8fdb\u4e00\u6b65\u63a2\u7d22\uff0c\u66f4\u53d1\u884c\u8fd9\u91cc\u7684\u52a8\u7269\u4e0e\u4eba\u7075\u9b42\u4f3c\u4e4e\u8fdb\u884c\u4e86\u4e0d\u53ef\u601d\u8bae\u7684\u5bf9\u8c03\u3002ta\u662f\u5426\u80fd\u4e00\u8def\u627e\u5230\u7ebf\u7d22\u89e3\u5f00\u68ee\u6797\u7684\u771f\u76f8\uff1f\u4ee5\u53ca\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u771f\u5b9e\u8eab\u4efd\uff1f \u9ad8\u81ea\u7531\u5ea6\uff0c\u591a\u79cd\u63a2\u7d22\u8def\u7ebf\uff0c\u4e0d\u65ad\u6d6e\u73b0\u7684\u96f6\u661f\u4fe1\u606f\u3002 \u7b80\u5355\u7684\u64cd\u4f5c\uff0c\u5305\u542b\u7740\u72ec\u5177\u5320\u5fc3\u7684\u8bbe\u8ba1\u548c\u8c1c\u9898\uff0c\u6bcf\u79cd\u9053\u5177\u90fd\u6709\u72ec\u7279\u7684\u529f\u80fd\u548c\u7528\u5904\uff0c\u9053\u8def\u5f80\u5f80\u5c31\u5728\u811a\u4e0b\u3002",
